  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 05/01/2026, the existing use of 5 Rossindel Road, Hounslow, TW3 3QN as a small house in multiple occupation with no more than 6 occupants (Use Class C4) as shown on drawings submitted on 16/02/2026 and numbered Claim payments to Hounslow from 10/01/2024 � 15/12/2025, Supporting statement, Paper receipts for cash payments 2014-2025, Tenancy agreements � 2014 � 2018, Tenancy agreements � 2020 � 2024, Temporary 1 year HMO license � 03/11/2025, PD.1, PD.2 is not lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason: \r\nThe applicant has failed to demonstrate that, on the balance of probabilities, the property has been in continuous use as an HMO (Use Class C4) for a period of at least ten years prior to the date of application.\r\n"
